message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "NWM: Negative Weight Mapping — A Non-Parametric Potential-Field Framework for Reinforcement Learning"
abstract: >-
  NWM is a non-parametric reinforcement learning framework that represents an
  agent's experience as a persistent potential field over the observation space,
  selecting actions from attractive (success) and repulsive (failure) forces.
